# OpenTofu/Terraform binary
#
# Temporary exception: terraform-aws-secrets-manager 0.13.0 fails to validate
# under the repo-wide OpenTofu 1.9.1 (null version_stages), and every later
# module release needs OpenTofu >= 1.11. Until all layers move to 1.13.2, this
# layer alone runs it. Drop this file once the repo-wide upgrade lands.
TF_BINARY=/usr/local/bin/tofu-1.13.2
